This repository (`t3-prism-optics`) is an independent derivative port and
extension adapted for **T3 Code Desktop**, built upon the zero-coupling optical
rendering engines (`engines/*.js`) of **Obsidian Prism** (`RMvdesi/obsidian-prism`).

Summary of original additions and modifications authored for T3 Prism Optics
(2026-11-26):
  - Zero-dependency Node >= 22 Chrome DevTools Protocol (CDP) hot-injection
    runtime, single-file bundle compiler, and bidirectional live config/telemetry
    bridges (`lib/cdp.js`, `lib/inject.js`, `lib/remove.js`, `lib/install.cjs`).
  - Local telemetry aggregator (`lib/telemetry.js`) parsing T3 Code usage caches,
    SQLite project metadata, and local Codex session JSONL logs (rate limits &
    6-month/all-time usage history) strictly on localhost.
  - Native T3 Code DOM adapter suite (`src/t3-*.js`, `src/t3-style.css`) for
    bidirectional reasoning effort sync, 4-layer flowing cosmic effort slider,
    5-stage `CSS.highlights` streaming ink feathering, 3-tab Studio dashboard,
    and functional sidebar Code | Chat workspace mode switching.

